        "original_id": "9c808e06-31ba-53fa-adac-cb80965f3bf4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alex Wyse, Jessica Stroup\n- Products: Iron Fist, The Bold and the Beautiful, Spring Awakening, The Defenders, 90210, The Following\n- Concepts: Marvel Cinematic Universe\n\nFacts:\n- Jessica Leigh Stroup was born on October 23, 1986, and she is an American actress.\n- In 2015, Alex Wyse played Georg Zirschnitz in the Deaf West Broadway revival of Spring Awakening.\n- Alex Wyse is best known for playing Kyle in Marvel's Iron Fist and Saul Feinberg in The Bold and the Beautiful.\n- Jessica Stroup is best known for playing Erin Silver on 90210, Max Hardy on The Following, and Joy Meachum in Iron Fist.\n- Iron Fist is set in the Marvel Cinematic Universe and shares continuity with the films in that franchise.\n- Iron Fist is the fourth in a series of shows that lead to The Defenders crossover miniseries.",
